  "stageId": "a003_04",
  "title": "他是將軍",
  "storyCode": "OF-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a3b452f378534d44248a73b09ea83a62b5aaf96ab5e4d4ba876d60b69d97e763",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "A隊，B隊，遠處盯緊了。C隊，從後面包圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "傭兵團的風格嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "有幾分實力，訓練的人有些水準，不過，還不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這，這個老頭好強！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "不在一個等級上。你們在旁邊守好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（這個女人......不簡單。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（這些保鏢雖然傷不到我，但她能夠對我造成威脅。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "愚蠢的外地人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（她很憤怒。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（站在她的立場上，或許真的是認為我們矇騙了錫蘭小姐。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（但是，有哪裡不對。這個人到底是......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "不愧是經驗豐富的傭兵，即使你家小姐被帶走也沒有亂了陣腳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "說什麼廢話！既然你知道我們頭曾經是......咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "text": "閉嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（......嗯？等等......弩，菲林，這個名字。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（我在哪裡聽說過這個名字......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等，這老頭要幹什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（雖然有些擔憂博士那邊的情況。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "（......不過以博士的能力，加上汐斯塔市內還有其他人在，應該問題不大。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他往我們這邊衝了，他瘋了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快，快攔住他！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "太慢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
